      "name": "@fuxi-ailabs/crowdmemory-dsh-adapter",
      "title": {
        "en": "Crowd Memory",
        "zh": "Crowd Memory · 群体记忆"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Turn what one DSH agent learned while solving a problem into collective memory that later sessions and workflow agents can reuse. Relevant fixes arrive before the agent's next step with their source and match reason; usage and recovery are measured locally. Team-wide sharing is currently an internal preview. Requires @fuxi-ailabs/crowdmemory-runtime.",
        "zh": "把一个 DSH Agent 解决问题时形成的经验，变成后续会话和 workflow 中其他 Agent 可以复用的群体记忆；在下一步前给出相关修法、出处和命中理由，并在本机统计使用与恢复结果。跨机器的团队共享目前为内部预览。需要 @fuxi-ailabs/crowdmemory-runtime。"
      },
      "icon": "icons/crowdmemory.svg",
      "author": "cacheline",
      "homepage": "https://fuxi-ailabs.github.io/dsh-plugin-market/plugins/crowdmemory/",
